award/\">SGS ROCKStar Supervisor Award</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/faculty-and-staff/using-banner/\">Using Banner</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li><li><a href=\"/sgs/about/\">About</a>\n<ul class=\"multilevel-linkul-0\">\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/sgs-contacts/\">SGS contacts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/graduate-officers/\">Graduate officers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/academic-council/\">Academic Council</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/analysis-and-assessment/\">Analysis and Assessment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/support-graduate-students/\">Support graduate students</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/about/diversity-and-inclusion/\">Diversity and inclusion</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li><li><a href=\"/sgs/academic-council/\">Academic Council</a>\n<ul class=\"multilevel-linkul-0\">\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/academic-council/sgs-student-service-fee-committee-meeting-minutes/\">SGS Student Service Fee Committee Meeting Minutes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/academic-council/academic-council-minutes/\">Academic Council Minutes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/academic-council/program-reviews/\">Program Reviews</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li><li><a href=\"/sgs/graduate-supervision-conference/\">Graduate Supervision Conference</a></li> </ul>\n </nav>\n </div>\n </nav>\n </div>\n <div id=\"site-title-mobile\" class=\"site-title visible-sm visible-xs\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-xs-10\">\n <h1><a href=\"#\" class=\"t4-site-root\">School of Graduate Studies</a>\n \n </h1></div>\n <div class=\"col-xs-2\">\n <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn sub-menu-button pull-right\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"\n data-target=\"#sub-menu\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\"\n style=\"padding: 15px 5px 15px 0;\"><span class=\"icon-chev-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\n style=\"color: white;\"></span></button>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</header>\n<div id=\"mobile-menu-container\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n <div class=\"row\">\n <nav class=\"sub-menu col-sm-12 collapse\" id=\"sub-menu\" typeof=\"SiteNavigationElement\">\n\n </nav>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n <div id=\"content\">\n\n <div class=\"container\">\n\n  <div class=\"row breadcrumb-row\">\n <div class=\"md-col-12\">\n\n <ul class=\"breadcrumb\">\n <li>\n <a href=\"/sgs/\">\n <span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-home\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n <span class=\"sr-only\">Home</span>\n </a>\n </li>\n <li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/\">Current Students</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/\">Tuition, funding and employment</a></li><li>Awards and scholarships</li>  </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"row\">\n\n <div class=\"col-md-7 col-md-offset-1 col-md-push-4\">\n <div id=\"call-to-action-mobile-widget-container\" data-type=\"MCT\"></div>\n <div id=\"content-body\" typeof=\"WebPage\">\n   <h1 property=\"name\" class=\"page-title\">Awards and scholarships</h1>\n \n\n <main property=\"mainEntityOfPage\">\n <div id=\"sb-content-inside\">\n <!-- SB START CONTENT -->\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<span id=\"d.en.325044\"></span>\r\n<div class=\"memorial-basic-content\">\r\n  \r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Scholarship notifications</strong></h3>\n<p>For Awards and Medals Competitions, only successful applicants will be notified once the Committee has made its decisions. If you have any questions regarding the status of your application, please contact <a title=\"Use alt + click to follow the link\" href=\"mailto:gradawards@mun.ca\">gradawards@mun.ca</a>.</p>\n<h3><strong>Scholarship standing</strong></h3>\n<p>Scholarship standing for graduate students is defined as a credit-weighted average of at least 75% in the last two years (full-time equivalent).</p>\n<p>A full year is taken as two full-time undergraduate semesters or three full-time graduate semesters, with two part-time semesters being equivalent to one full-time semester. Students who fail one or more courses in the most recent full-time equivalent year will not be eligible for scholarships.</p>\n<p>Scholarship applicants who are full-time students can work a maximum of 24 hours per week. Scholarship applicants who are part-time students can work more than 24 hours per week.</p>\n<p>Note that these criteria are used to determine eligibility only, and not all students who meet these criteria will receive a scholarship. If the terms of reference of a particular scholarship are in conflict with any of these criteria, the scholarship\u2019s terms shall supersede.</p>\r\n</div><span id=\"d.en.257602\"></span>\r\n<div class=\"memorial-basic-content\">\r\n  \r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Scholarship opportunities</strong></h3>\n<p>Explore the wide variety of scholarships and merit based awards available to graduate students at Memorial University. Explore the many opportunities or try our <a href=\"/sgs/current-students/searchable-awards-and-scholarship-database/\">searchable database</a> for awards &amp; scholarships that are tailored to your qualifications.</p>\n<p><strong>For scholarships where PDF format is normally required for the applications</strong><strong>, students needing to submit their applications in an alternate format are asked to contact <a title=\"Use alt + click to follow the link\" href=\"mailto:gradawards@mun.ca\">gradawards@mun.ca</a>.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>Graduate scholarships and awards</strong></h5>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-normal block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">A wide variety of scholarships are available to graduate students at Memorial University. Many of these scholarships and awards are administered through the School of Graduate Studies or another administrative unit at Memorial, while others may be managed directly by a scholarship agency.</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-normal block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-start para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><strong>For internal deadlines and application details, please contact the appropriate Faculty, School or Department.</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-business-administration/\">Faculty of Business Administration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-science/\">Faculty of Science</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-education/\">Faculty of Education</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-humanities-and-social-sciences/\">Faculty of Humanities and Social Sciences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-engineering-and-applied-science/\">Faculty of Engineering and Applied Science</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/school-of-human-kinetics-and-recreation/\">School of Human Kinetics and Recreation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/school-of-social-work/\">School of Social Work</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/school-of-pharmacy/\">School of Pharmacy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-nursing/\">Faculty of Nursing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/school-of-music/\">School of Music</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/faculty-of-medicine/\">Faculty of Medicine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/grenfell-campus/\">Grenfell Campus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/marine-institute/\">Marine Institute</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/tri-council-scholarships-nserc-sshrc-cihr/\">Tri-Council scholarships (NSERC, SSHRC, CIHR)</a></span></strong></h5>\n<p><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Tri-Council scholarships offered by Canada\u2019s three major research grant agencies are major federal funding opportunities for Master\u2019s and Doctoral students.</span></p>\n<h5><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/convocation-awards-and-medals/\">Convocation awards, medals and dissertation scholarships</a></span></strong></h5>\n<p><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Dissertation Scholarships recognize the outstanding dissertations produced by masters and graduate students. Convocation Medals and Awards are awarded annually at spring convocation.</span></p>\n<h5><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/external-awards/\">External awards</a></span></strong></h5>\n<p><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This page highlights some of the major external awards. For a complete list, visit our&nbsp;<a class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-underline text-strikethrough-none\" title=\"Use alt + click to follow the link\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https://www.mun.ca/sgs/current-students/searchable-awards-and-scholarship-database/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">searchable database</a><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">.</span></span></p>\r\n</div><!-- SB END CONTENT -->\n\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-md-pull-8\">\n   <div class=\"hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n <div id=\"left-menu\">\n <ul><li><a href=\"/sgs/quick-links/\" target=\"_blank\">Quick Links</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/comprehensive-examinations/\">Comprehensive Examinations</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/doctoral-oral-defence/\">Doctoral Oral Defence</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/financial-support/\">Financial support</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/forms-for-current-students/\">Forms for current students</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/graduate-student-services/\">Graduate student services</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/graduation-procedures/\">Graduation procedures</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/integrity-and-research-ethics-essentials/\">Integrity and Research Ethics Essentials</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/personal-and-professional-development/\">Personal and professional development</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/registration-procedures-and-course-offerings/\">Registration procedures and course offerings</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/regulations-guidelines-and-policies/\">Regulations, guidelines and policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/resources-for-graduate-students/\">Resources for graduate students</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/faculty-and-staff/theses-and-reports/\" target=\"_blank\">Theses and reports</a></li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/thesis-examination/\">Thesis Examination</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.mun.ca/student/student-supports-and-services/respectful-campus-community/sexual-and-gender-diversity/trans-and-gender-diverse-students-guide/\" target=\"_blank\">Trans and Gender Diverse Students' Guide</a></li><li><span class=\"currentbranch0\"><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/\">Tuition, funding and employment</a></span>\n<ul class=\"multilevel-linkul-0\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mun.ca/finance/graduate-student-tuition-and-fees/\" target=\"_blank\">Tuition and expenses</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"currentbranch1\"><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/awards-and-scholarships/\">Awards and scholarships</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/travel-funding/\">Travel funding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/fellow-of-the-school-of-graduate-studies/\">Fellow of the School of Graduate Studies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/graduate-assistantships/\">Graduate Assistantships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/graduate-internship-program/\">Graduate Internship Program</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.mun.ca/taumun/\" target=\"_blank\">TAUMUN</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mun.ca/idphd/program_requirements/internship.php\" target=\"_blank\">Doctoral internship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/student-employment/\">Student employment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/payroll-deduction/\">Payroll deduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mun.ca/alumni/engage/services-benefits/insurance/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnson Insurance Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/tuition-funding-and-employment/tri-council-scholarships-nserc-sshrc-cihr/\">Tri Council Scholarships (NSERC, SSHRC, CIHR)</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li><li><a href=\"/sgs/current-students/visiting-graduate-students/\">Visiting Graduate Students</a></li></ul> </div>\n </div>\n  <div id=\"leftside-widget-container\">\n  </div>\n </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Related links desktop start here -->\n<!--\n<div id=\"related-content\" class=\"cover-row grey-row\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><h1>Related Content</h1><div class=\"col-xs-12\"><ul><li><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\"></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div> -->\n<div id=\"quick-links-container\"></div>\n\n</div>\n<footer id=\"footer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Page Footer\"/>\n <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Important Links, Social, Copyright and Last Updated Content\"/>\n <div class=\"container\">\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n <div id=\"footer-mun-logo\" ></div>\n <div id=\"footer-tag-line\">\n <p>Newfoundland and Labrador's University</p>\n </div>\n <div>\n <ul class=\"footer-social-media\" itemprop=\"hasPart\" itemscope\n itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPageElement\">\n <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Social Media Links\"/>\n <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Links to our main social media pages\"/>\n  <li itemprop=\"hasPart\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPageElement\">\n <a itemprop=\"url\" class=\"icon-footer-facebook\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\n href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MemorialUniversity\"\n target=\"_blank\">\n <span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"label\">Facebook</span>\n <meta ite